    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the thrilling world of &quot;Survival for Treasure&quot;, an immersive survival game where you will face hordes of zombies in order to reach your goal. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will play as a brave adventurer who volunteered to explore a zombie-infested island in search of a safe filled with money. Your mission will be to navigate through various zones of the island, locate the safe, and retrieve the money as quickly as possible, before safely returning to your starting point. Be vigilant, as zombies lurk around every corner, seeking to eliminate you. You will need to equip yourself with weapons and useful items, devise clever strategies to evade zombie attacks, and successfully locate the precious safe within the given timeframe.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n!!!! Warning !!!!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlease note that the game may contain some bugs, as it has been developed by a single person. We kindly ask for your understanding and encourage you to report any issues you may encounter, so that we can address them. We are committed to continuously improving the game to provide you with the best possible experience. Thank you for your support!",
